### Raw benchmarks found

Three independent public searches yielded no traceable benchmark results for this exact identity. Anthropic's [Sonnet product page](https://www.anthropic.com/claude/sonnet) and [Platform models documentation](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models) list Sonnet 5.5, Sonnet 5, and earlier Sonnet versions, but no Sonnet 5.4. The live [models.dev Anthropic catalog](https://models.dev/) and [OpenRouter model catalog](https://openrouter.ai/models) also had no exact Sonnet 5.4 entry when checked on 2026-10-29. Search results that surfaced Sonnet 5 benchmark scores did not identify a 5.4 version and are not attributed to this label.

